{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "header",
      "content": {
        "json": "# PTU Validation\nUse this workbook to validate the initial PTU pool against current Azure OpenAI / Foundry usage. Every chart is a single metric at **1-minute grain**, so each point is a per-minute value (Sum = requests or tokens per minute).\n\n**How to use:** pick the resource and time range, then look for sustained peaks. Drag across any chart to zoom all charts to that window; re-select the time range to reset. Charts render up to **3 days** at 1-minute grain - for a longer period, step through it with a Custom range or use `Get-PtuMetrics.ps1`."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "name": "parameters",
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 1,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "p-resource",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Resource",
            "label": "Foundry / Azure OpenAI resource",
            "type": 5,
            "isRequired": true,
            "query": "resources\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts'\n| where kind in~ ('OpenAI', 'AIServices')\n| project id, name\n| order by name asc",
            "crossComponentResources": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "typeSettings": {
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 1,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-time",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "label": "Time range",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 86400000
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 3600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 14400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 43200000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 86400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 259200000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "capacity-header",
      "content": {
        "json": "## Capacity\n**Utilization V2 (Max):** sustained peaks at or above 80-90% mean the pool is tight; 100% means requests are being throttled (429). **Active Tokens:** tokens minus cache hits - the load that actually consumes PTU capacity. Both only report provisioned (PTU) deployments."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "name": "ptu-utilization-max",
      "content": {
        "chartId": "ptu-utilization-max",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": [
          "{Resource}"
        ],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 86400000
        },
        "timeGrain": "PT1M",
        "metrics": [
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts-Azure OpenAI  Usage-AzureOpenAIProvisionedManagedUtilizationV2",
            "aggregation": 3,
            "splitBy": [
              "ModelDeploymentName"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "title": "Provisioned-managed Utilization V2 (Max) by deployment",
        "timeBrushParameterName": "TimeRange",
        "showOpenInMe": true,
        "gridSettings": {
          "rowLimit": 10000
        }
      },
      "customWidth": "50"
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "name": "active-tokens-sum",
      "content": {
        "chartId": "active-tokens-sum",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": [
          "{Resource}"
        ],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 86400000
        },
        "timeGrain": "PT1M",
        "metrics": [
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts-Azure OpenAI  Usage-ActiveTokens",
            "aggregation": 1,
            "splitBy": [
              "ModelDeploymentName"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "title": "Active Tokens (Sum per minute) by deployment",
        "timeBrushParameterName": "TimeRange",
        "showOpenInMe": true,
        "gridSettings": {
          "rowLimit": 10000
        }
      },
      "customWidth": "50"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "demand-header",
      "content": {
        "json": "## Demand\nRequests and tokens per minute for every deployment (PTU and pay-as-you-go). Size from sustained peaks, not averages. Completion (output) tokens consume more PTU capacity than prompt (input) tokens, so compare both."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "name": "requests-sum",
      "content": {
        "chartId": "requests-sum",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": [
          "{Resource}"
        ],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 86400000
        },
        "timeGrain": "PT1M",
        "metrics": [
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts-Azure OpenAI  HTTP Requests-AzureOpenAIRequests",
            "aggregation": 1,
            "splitBy": [
              "ModelDeploymentName"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "title": "Azure OpenAI Requests (Sum per minute) by deployment",
        "timeBrushParameterName": "TimeRange",
        "showOpenInMe": true,
        "gridSettings": {
          "rowLimit": 10000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "name": "prompt-tokens-sum",
      "content": {
        "chartId": "prompt-tokens-sum",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": [
          "{Resource}"
        ],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 86400000
        },
        "timeGrain": "PT1M",
        "metrics": [
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts-Azure OpenAI  Usage-ProcessedPromptTokens",
            "aggregation": 1,
            "splitBy": [
              "ModelDeploymentName"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "title": "Processed Prompt Tokens (Sum per minute) by deployment",
        "timeBrushParameterName": "TimeRange",
        "showOpenInMe": true,
        "gridSettings": {
          "rowLimit": 10000
        }
      },
      "customWidth": "50"
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "name": "completion-tokens-sum",
      "content": {
        "chartId": "completion-tokens-sum",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": [
          "{Resource}"
        ],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 86400000
        },
        "timeGrain": "PT1M",
        "metrics": [
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts-Azure OpenAI  Usage-GeneratedTokens",
            "aggregation": 1,
            "splitBy": [
              "ModelDeploymentName"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "title": "Generated Completion Tokens (Sum per minute) by deployment",
        "timeBrushParameterName": "TimeRange",
        "showOpenInMe": true,
        "gridSettings": {
          "rowLimit": 10000
        }
      },
      "customWidth": "50"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "throttling-header",
      "content": {
        "json": "## Throttling and spillover\n**429** responses are demand the deployment did not absorb. **IsSpillover = true** are requests that overflowed from PTU to a standard deployment. Both indicate unmet PTU demand and should be added on top of observed utilization when sizing."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "name": "requests-by-status-sum",
      "content": {
        "chartId": "requests-by-status-sum",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": [
          "{Resource}"
        ],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 86400000
        },
        "timeGrain": "PT1M",
        "metrics": [
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts-Azure OpenAI  HTTP Requests-AzureOpenAIRequests",
            "aggregation": 1,
            "splitBy": [
              "StatusCode"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "title": "Azure OpenAI Requests (Sum per minute) by status code",
        "timeBrushParameterName": "TimeRange",
        "showOpenInMe": true,
        "gridSettings": {
          "rowLimit": 10000
        }
      },
      "customWidth": "50"
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "name": "requests-by-spillover-sum",
      "content": {
        "chartId": "requests-by-spillover-sum",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": [
          "{Resource}"
        ],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 86400000
        },
        "timeGrain": "PT1M",
        "metrics": [
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts-Azure OpenAI  HTTP Requests-AzureOpenAIRequests",
            "aggregation": 1,
            "splitBy": [
              "IsSpillover"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "title": "Azure OpenAI Requests (Sum per minute) by spillover",
        "timeBrushParameterName": "TimeRange",
        "showOpenInMe": true,
        "gridSettings": {
          "rowLimit": 10000
        }
      },
      "customWidth": "50"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "notes",
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n**Notes:** The metrics API returns 1-minute data for 7 days, but the workbook charts render blank above roughly 3 days of 1-minute points (tested: 3 days renders, 7 days does not). Use `Get-PtuMetrics.ps1` for week-long P95/P99 figures. Utilization V2 cannot be exported through diagnostic settings - read it here or in Metrics Explorer. Customer/agent-level usage requires APIM token metrics in Application Insights."
      }
    }
  ],
  "fallbackResourceIds": [
    "Azure Monitor"
  ],
  "$schema": "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json"
}
